Package: stamp-suite
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: STAMP network measurement sender and reflector
 stamp-suite implements the Simple Two-Way Active Measurement Protocol
 (STAMP, RFC 8762 and RFC 8972) to measure round-trip time, packet loss
 and one-way delay between two hosts.
 .
 A single binary runs either as the Session-Sender, which sends test
 packets and reports results, or with --is-reflector as the
 Session-Reflector, which answers them. The package installs a systemd
 unit that runs the reflector as the unprivileged stamp user.
